11:T8c7,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I get a fully funded scholarship without IELTS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Possibly. Some scholarship routes do not impose a universal IELTS condition, but the selected university may still require IELTS, another test, MOI or an internal assessment. Verify the scholarship, admission and visa rules separately."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is an MOI certificate accepted instead of IELTS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Some institutions accept an official Medium of Instruction certificate, while others do not. Acceptance can depend on your previous qualification, institution, nationality, programme and intake. Obtain written confirmation from the admitting university."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Pakistani students apply for scholarships without IELTS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, when the scholarship and selected institution accept an alternative such as MOI, another test or an interview. Pakistani applicants must also check any HEC nomination, testing and document requirements that apply to the scholarship route."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does an IELTS waiver also cover the student visa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not automatically. University admission and immigration are separate processes. Check the destination government's current student-visa rules and ask the university how your English ability will be recorded for visa purposes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which English tests may be accepted instead of IELTS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Depending on the programme, alternatives can include TOEFL, PTE Academic, Cambridge English or the Duolingo English Test. Accepted versions, scores and validity periods vary, so use the exact programme page rather than a general list."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Should I take IELTS even if a waiver is available?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Consider your whole shortlist. A test score may open more universities and reduce uncertainty, while a confirmed waiver may save time and cost. Choose the route that keeps the strongest-fit programmes available to you."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Scholarship and international opportunity guides\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Scholarships without IELTS for international students in 2027\",\"item\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/scholarships-without-ielts/\"}]}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Scholarships without IELTS for international students in 2027\",\"description\":\"Can you apply for scholarships without IELTS? Compare MOI, alternative tests and Chevening, MEXT and Hungary routes; check admission and visa rules separately.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-08-31\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-09-20\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/scholarships-without-ielts/\"}"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$11"}}]],"$L12","$L13","$L14"]}]
